And today was the day,

00:00:07.741 --> 00:00:08.441
the parade day,

00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:10.643
and it was anything but at one point.

00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:12.078
You could count it.

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:15.682
Just one tank rolled across Red Square,

00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:17.017
a sign that Putin's war

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:17.717
