00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:24.991
Scores of tanks on display,

00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:26.292
all kinds of flyovers.

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:28.261
I mean, hypersonic missiles going by.

00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:29.829
That's that's what it was.

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:31.197
And yet, despite the muted event

00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:32.399
today, Putin

00:00:32.399 --> 00:00:33.767
verbally was as defiant

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:34.734
