00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:36.403
Russia is the one under attack

00:00:36.403 --> 00:00:38.838
after he, of course, invaded Ukraine.

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:42.709
A real war is being waged

00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:44.444
against our country again.

00:00:44.444 --> 00:00:45.478
But we have countered

00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:46.913
international terrorism

00:00:46.913 --> 00:00:49.082
and will defend the people of Donbass.

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:50.850
And safeguard our security.

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:52.719
OUTFRONT

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:54.120
now, Ilya Ponomarev,

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:55.822
