00:00:55.822 --> 00:00:57.223
who was forced into exile

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:59.492
after he was the only Russian lawmaker

00:00:59.492 --> 00:00:59.826
to vote

00:00:59.826 --> 00:01:01.194
against Putin's

00:01:01.194 --> 00:01:03.897
annexation of Crimea in 2014.

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:04.264
And Ilya,

00:01:04.264 --> 00:01:05.965
I so much appreciate your time tonight.

00:01:05.965 --> 00:01:08.268
So when you saw the images today of that

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:10.470
the victory parade, right.

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:11.304
And then just

00:01:11.304 --> 00:01:12.305
a bunch of

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:15.008
military vehicles in that one tank.

00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:16.743
