00:01:17.277 --> 00:01:19.913
Moreover, this tank was 30, 34 of

00:01:20.246 --> 00:01:21.281
the main

00:01:21.281 --> 00:01:23.850
Soviet tank during World War Two.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:25.585
