00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:27.020
They were removed

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:29.222
from the production in 1945

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:31.224
just after the war.

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:34.561
So yeah, basically it shows that Putin

00:01:34.561 --> 00:01:36.830
