00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:39.466
that happened from the we saw it.

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:42.268
He was afraid that it would be repeated

00:01:43.803 --> 00:01:44.904
on the main line.

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:47.407
And that's why he forced the hostages.

00:01:47.407 --> 00:01:48.141
He invited

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:52.178
